{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9DaGluZXNlLU1vdmllcy9SZWQlMjBTb3JnaHVtJTIwJTI4MTk4OCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Red Sorghum","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2CP2eazEBKJ3njm4HM63pMfs5tW.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4bjVA2NrkrdNPPpKUt7eR2P3xlf.jpg","description":"An old leper who owned a remote sorghum winery dies. Jiu'er, the wife bought by the leper, and her lover, identified only as \"my Grandpa\" by the narrator, take over the winery and set up an idealized quasi-matriarchal community headed by Jiu'er. When the Japanese invaders subject the area to their rule and cut down the sorghum to make way for a road, the community rises up and resists as the sorghum grows anew.","releaseInfo":"1988","genres":["Drama","Romance","History","Others"],"imdbRating":"7.4","runtime":"91 min","cast":["Gong Li","Jiang Wen","Teng Rujun","Liu Ji","Qian Ming","Ji Chunhua","Zhai Chunhua","Jia Zhaoji"],"director":["Zhang Yimou"],"released":"1988-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Gong Li","character":"Jiu'er","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/m3q1rIEdZmOnUVC0MSo1FcIGvp9.jpg"},{"name":"Jiang Wen","character":"Yu","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/u6VjywO6Z8nTqPGgFu7V6NDs1xj.jpg"},{"name":"Teng Rujun","character":"Uncle Luohan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/p3RMCjlrVK84Ud2TJHaE437Bd9N.jpg"},{"name":"Liu Ji","character":"Jiu'er's Son"},{"name":"Qian Ming","character":"Jiu'er's Grandmother"},{"name":"Ji Chunhua","character":"Sanpao","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4z5lkrxI2tYlRjbWPUvbhpsRFxi.jpg"},{"name":"Zhai Chunhua","character":"Hu Er","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/t8dCayxGYp9dG0Xz2Jiv3rXc5ZQ.jpg"},{"name":"Jia Zhaoji","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8TFsFDKuXvCrXNBIsQUjHIKCpuF.jpg"},{"name":"Zhang Yuxiang"},{"name":"Zhou Guiyun","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rS6a2ZubK0DtH1JCS6uXo7iix38.jpg"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"MF